	<section class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_5376" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="5376" data-source-page-id="958" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_5376">Scholars' Center for the Humanities</h2>
			<div class="fsElementHeaderContent">
				<p>The Scholars&#39; Center for the Humanities&nbsp;offers a program that will prepare students for numerous professional options through a curriculum that is both broad in scope and comprehensive in content, focusing on the American experience.&nbsp;</p>

<p><a class="button-arrow-on-dark" href="https://sites.google.com/frhsd.com/the-scholars-center-for-the-hu/home?authuser=0">Find Out More</a></p>

			</div>
